{"ref":"BDB, עֲזֵקָה","hw":"עֲזֵקָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עֲזֵקָה</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc.</strong> Αζηκα, in the Shephelah of Judah, near <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂוֹכֹה</span>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:10\" href=\"/Joshua.10.10\">Jos 10:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:11\" href=\"/Joshua.10.11\">11</a> (JE), <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:35\" href=\"/Joshua.15.35\">15:35</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:1\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.1\">1 S 17:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 34:7\" href=\"/Jeremiah.34.7\">Je 34:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 11:9\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.11.9\">2 Ch 11:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:30\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.30\">Ne 11:30</a>; not identified.","next":"BDB, עָזַר","prev":"BDB, עָזַק"}